{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1449350-how-bad-could-that-be-1001-dramatic-failures","id":1449350,"title":"\"How bad could that be?\": 1001 dramatic failures","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-23T08:18:16-07:00","id":1449350,"title":"\"How bad could that be?\": 1001 dramatic failures","content":"I feel like I often struggle to determine what happens when a player chooses to downgrade a failure into a dramatic one to get those sweet Beats. Several times what I come up with is just a minor inconvenience that gets soon neglected. In a couple of occasions, even if the failure introduced an effect such as a Blinded Tilt or Condition (and we even put down the card as a reminder), we kinda forgot the player had it, or assumed that it faded away.<br /> Also, I'm not really sure how hard should the ST be when introducing dramatic failures, especially for easily quantifiable effects (e.g. if the character suffers damage as a result, how much damage/attack pool would be recommended? )<br /> <br /> So, I'd like to ask you to share some examples of dramatic failures you had or introduced in your games. I guess we'll see some very interesting and funny ones <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26440-moonwhisper","name":"moonwhisper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26440_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T11:16:50-07:00","id":1449474,"title":"","content":"One of my player tried to sneak into a vampires cove.<br /> She failed the stealth roll, and decided to convert it to a dramatic one.<br /> Some vampires then took interest in her intrusion and started to investigate on her, with hostile intent.<br /> The player decided to accept an offer from a vampire, rival of the group, for a safe place, but with a price...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T16:09:02-07:00","id":1449725,"title":"","content":"Player did a dramatic failure while trying to navigate the Temenos, ended up in Pac-Man. As Pac-Man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}